    "body": "This PR adds missing Doxygen (`//!`) comments to the public methods of the `BanMan` class in `src/banman.h`. \r\n\r\nWhile some methods like `IsBanned` and `IsDiscouraged` already had documentation, others like `Ban`, `Discourage`, `Unban`, and `ClearBanned` were undocumented. This improves API readability and consistency.\r\n",
